OL,3,GNEWSATwenty-seven people trapped on
OL,4,Arollercoaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have rescued 27 people who
OL,7,Fwere stuck on a rollercoaster for up to
OL,8,Fthree hours.
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,11,Fwas called to Pleasurewood Hills in
OL,12,FLowestoft at 13:36 BST.
OL,14,FA spokesperson said the carriages of
OL,15,Fthe Wipeout ride came to a stop on the
OL,16,Ftrack, while approximately 15m (49ft)
OL,17,Fin the air, "but not upside-down".
OL,19,FPark visitor Richard Lines said he was
OL,20,Fon another ride at the park, close to
OL,21,FWipeout, when a power cut appeared to
OL,22,Feffect multiple rides.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
